{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age, a fantasy world full of goblins, elves, and wizards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city of Ranorya is a powerful port city, and the merchants guild holds a monthly competition for the city's trade license. Merchants who come to the city from outside to trade try to keep their shops afloat for 1 semester, to become the richest or most respected shop, in order to get an annual license.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your own shop, trade goods, and beat other merchants. Use smart strategies to grow your business and become the richest trader. Will you succeed, or will your rivals win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age, your goal is to become the top merchant. Buy and sell goods, set prices, and stay ahead of your rivals. But be careful! Your competitors will cheat, use magic, and make secret deals to beat you. You can play Trade Rivals against up to 3 friends! Outsmart them with clever strategies and become the best merchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Changing Markets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the start of each game, you\u2019ll face a unique scenario that changes inflation and the city\u2019s economy. No two games are the same! The market changes with crashes, booms, and inflation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LUCK Wheel &amp; Rare Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy rare and powerful items in the luck market. They can bring big profits\u2014or big risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fantasy Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell to goblins, elves, and wizards. Each one wants different things. Learn what they like to make more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategy &amp; Tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sabotage your rivals, form alliances, or make secret deals. Every choice changes the game. Will you play fair or get dirty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420920?t=1747033019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/0ec7398a808f7f7f738d0d095befe1312bff4525/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747033019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/4740323ff50777ab57f6b5bb58c76413d65ea562/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747033019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/4740323ff50777ab57f6b5bb58c76413d65ea562/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747033019","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age, a fantasy world full of goblins, elves, and wizards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city of Ranorya is a powerful port city, and the merchants guild holds a monthly competition for the city's trade license. Merchants who come to the city from outside to trade try to keep their shops afloat for 1 semester, to become the richest or most respected shop, in order to get an annual license.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your own shop, trade goods, and beat other merchants. Use smart strategies to grow your business and become the richest trader. Will you succeed, or will your rivals win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Trade Rivals \u2013 Goblin Age, your goal is to become the top merchant. Buy and sell goods, set prices, and stay ahead of your rivals. But be careful! Your competitors will cheat, use magic, and make secret deals to beat you. You can play Trade Rivals against up to 3 friends! Outsmart them with clever strategies and become the best merchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Changing Markets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the start of each game, you\u2019ll face a unique scenario that changes inflation and the city\u2019s economy. No two games are the same! The market changes with crashes, booms, and inflation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LUCK Wheel &amp; Rare Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy rare and powerful items in the luck market. They can bring big profits\u2014or big risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fantasy Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell to goblins, elves, and wizards. Each one wants different things. Learn what they like to make more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategy &amp; Tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sabotage your rivals, form alliances, or make secret deals. Every choice changes the game. Will you play fair or get dirty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Roog Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420920/header.jpg?t=1747033019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":2571